Zandatsu (Android, Phase 6): integrate ZeroFG v1.1.0 (ReallyZero / Zero) into Renut present.
Supports both 30->60 FPS (with dbz3_frameskip=1) and 60->120 FPS (on >=100 Hz displays) via swordman_zerofg_mode.
Drains banjo_renut_record worker before recording ZeroFG compute dispatches onto the real VkCommandBuffer,
uses linear gamma=1.0 on history copy, and caps ZeroFG working height (swordman_zerofg_max_height=720) for Mali speed.

